      "content": "yeah, exactly. like the scars are all that's left. and i'm just sitting here watching the world go on without me. i look at people living their lives and i just don't see a place for me anymore. it's like i've already checked out, i'm just waiting for my body to realize it. does it ever get easier to just... stop fighting it?",
